Use system SQLite (recover extension only), dlib, libsensors and libJudy
instead of the vendored copies.

Origin: rebased onto netdata 2.13.0 from ::gentoo's
netdata-2.11.1-system-libs.patch by Arthur Zamarin <arthurzam@gentoo.org>.
Same intent as the original; 2.13.0 moved the libJudy and libsensors build
rules (src/libnetdata/CMakeLists.txt, NetdataPluginDebugfs.cmake) and added
include_guard() to the SQLite module, so those hunks were redone.

